        "π C1-C3 -> lp C1"
      ],
      "explanationAfterStep": "Excess piperidine adds to the CH₂ end of dibenzofulvene, a conjugate addition that re-forms the aromatic anion. Trapping matters: free dibenzofulvene would otherwise react with the newly freed amine."
    },
    {
      "stepKey": "carbanion-protonated",
      "fromStateId": "adduct-zwitterion",
      "toStateId": "adduct",
